%S A398567 16,82,504,3178,20072,126872,801852,5068178,32033176,202465954,
%T A398567 1279683492,8088233608,51121618328,323113855706,2042238875544,
%U A398567 12907956945698,81584653381936,515655244421272,3259195445154324,20599722529292746,130200405385659896,822930772000130666
%N A398567 Number of perfect matchings in a 3 X 2n grid graph on the Klein bottle.
%C A398567 The graph is obtained from the 3 X 2n grid by adding cyclic wrap-around edges in the 2n-direction and Möbius twist edges in the 3-direction: vertex (2,c) is connected to (0, 2n-1-c). This twist is genuine and does not reduce to the torus case, as verified by direct isomorphism comparison for small n. Parallel edges arising from the quotient are kept distinct (multigraph convention). For n=1 this gives a(1)=16. If parallel edges were merged (simple graph convention), the first term would be 6. The case of a 2 X 2n grid (m=2) is completely solved (see A162485, A351635, A020878, A048788). The width-3 Möbius strip case is A263200.
%H A398567 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A398567/b398567.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..500</a>
%H A398567 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A398567/a398567.py.txt">Python program</a>
%H A398567 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (4,16,-6,-16,4,1).
%F A398567 a(n) = 4*a(n-1) + 16*a(n-2) - 6*a(n-3) - 16*a(n-4) + 4*a(n-5) + a(n-6) for n >= 7.
%F A398567 a(n)/a(n-1) tends to the dominant root of the order-6 recurrence, approximately 6.3204931624, which is the largest root of x^4 - 6*x^3 - 3*x^2 + 6*x + 1 = 0 (a factor of the characteristic polynomial).
%F A398567 G.f.: 2*x*(8 + 9*x - 40*x^2 - 27*x^3 + 22*x^4 + 4*x^5)/((1 + 2*x - x^2)*(1 - 6*x - 3*x^2 + 6*x^3 + x^4)). - _Andrew Howroyd_, Aug 03 2026
%e A398567 For n=1, the 3 X 2 Klein bottle grid has 16 perfect matchings (multigraph convention).
%e A398567 For n=2, the 3 X 4 grid has 82 perfect matchings.
%e A398567 For n=3, the 3 X 6 grid has 504 perfect matchings.
%t A398567 LinearRecurrence[{4, 16, -6, -16, 4, 1}, {16, 82, 504, 3178, 20072, 126872}, 25] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Aug 13 2026 *)
%o A398567 (Python) # See Links section for program.
%Y A398567 Cf. A162485 (2 X n Klein bottle, twist on side 2), A351635 (2 X n Klein bottle, twist on side n), A020878 (2 X n Möbius strip), A048788 (2 X n Möbius strip, alternate twist), A005178 (plane, 4 X (n-1)), A263200 (Möbius strip, width 3, length 2n).
%K A398567 nonn,easy
%O A398567 1,1
%A A398567 _Jean Lauro Muller_, Aug 02 2026
